WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.539
Namaste.

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:07.408
Is video mein hum The Ray ko General Store ya kisi bhi doosri dukaan ke liye step by step use karenge.

00:00:07.408 --> 00:00:10.102
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:10.102 --> 00:00:22.291
Agar aapka business kisi khaas category mein fit nahi hota, jaise stationery, mobile accessories, gift ya kapde, to General Store ka flow ek saada aur flexible billing app deta hai.

00:00:22.651 --> 00:00:24.583
Ye Gupta Traders ka Home hai.

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:31.843
Wahi teen cheezein jo har dukaan ko chahiye: aaj ki sales, kis se paisa aana hai, aur kya khatam ho raha hai.

00:00:31.843 --> 00:00:35.040
Neeche recent bills aur festival reminder. Kyun?

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:39.902
Kyunki chhoti dukaan mein bhi owner ko din ka haal ek nazar mein chahiye.

00:00:40.265 --> 00:00:46.917
Naya bill. Ek existing customer chunte hain, aur do items: Mobile Charger aur Boat Earphones.

00:00:46.917 --> 00:00:52.925
In par MRP likha hai aur bikri ki price kam hai, aur bill mein wahi price lagti hai.

00:00:52.925 --> 00:00:59.076
Do rupaye ka discount ya kul ek fix amount ka discount, ye Complete bill par aata hai.

00:00:59.442 --> 00:01:04.633
Discount ab rupaye mein. Flat amount chunte hain aur pachaas rupaye likhte hain.

00:01:04.633 --> 00:01:11.771
Customer ko poora udhaar par dena hai, isliye Full udhaar chunte hain. Ye customer ke khata mein chadh jayega.

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:13.653
Generate invoice dabate hain.

00:01:14.026 --> 00:01:21.011
Invoice ban gaya. Yahan se A four, thermal, PDF ya WhatsApp. Aur neeche ek Return ka button bhi hai.

00:01:21.011 --> 00:01:31.629
Agar customer koi saaman wapas kare, to Return dabate hain, item aur quantity chunte hain, aur bill, stock aur khata teeno apne aap theek ho jaate hain.

00:01:31.629 --> 00:01:37.357
Kyun? Kyunki wapsi haath se likhne mein stock aur udhaar dono galat ho jaate hain.

00:01:37.925 --> 00:01:45.204
Customers. Kisi bhi customer ko kholo to khata, history, aur Remind aur Statement PDF ke button.

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:52.256
Statement PDF customer ko bhejne ke liye ek saaf hisaab ki copy hai, jo bahes se bachati hai.

00:01:53.939 --> 00:02:00.520
Ab Products. Naya item jodne ke liye Plus Product. Sirf naam, price aur GST chahiye.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:06.317
Naam likhte hain Phone Cover, price ek sau ninyanave, GST atharah percent.

00:02:06.317 --> 00:02:11.174
Aur zyada options mein MRP, barcode, category aur stock. Kyun?

00:02:11.174 --> 00:02:17.990
Kyunki dukaan ke liye pehle din se sab kuch bharna zaroori nahi, jitna chahiye utna hi.

00:02:23.284 --> 00:02:25.868
Save dabate hain. Item list mein aa gaya.

00:02:25.868 --> 00:02:34.059
Stock track karne ka option on ho to har bill ke saath stock apne aap ghatta hai, aur jab kam hota hai to Low ka nishaan aata hai.

00:02:34.059 --> 00:02:37.336
Yahin se barcode labels ka print bhi hota hai. Kyun?

00:02:37.336 --> 00:02:41.495
Kyunki bina stock ke pata nahi chalta ki kya khatam hone wala hai.

00:02:41.849 --> 00:02:49.102
Purchases. Vendor se maal aane par yahan likhte hain: vendor, unka invoice number, item, quantity aur rate.

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:55.068
Save purchase dabate hi stock badh jata hai, aur input GST ka record ban jata hai. Kyun?

00:02:55.068 --> 00:03:00.220
Kyunki purchase likhne se hi pata chalta hai ki aapka asli munafa kitna hai.

00:03:00.596 --> 00:03:09.213
Quantity bees, rate tin sau saath rupaye. Neeche paid now aur method, aur input tax credit ka tick.

00:03:09.213 --> 00:03:14.087
Save dabate hain. Ab charger ka stock bees se badh gaya.

00:03:14.461 --> 00:03:15.657
Reports aur GST.

00:03:15.657 --> 00:03:27.397
Wahi poori report list jo har dukaan ko milti hai: daily summary, sales, profit, udhaar aging, aur GST ke teen reports GSTR 1, GSTR 3B aur purchase register.

00:03:27.397 --> 00:03:32.481
Aaj ke bill aur purchase ka data in mein apne aap aa gaya hai. Kyun?

00:03:32.481 --> 00:03:37.192
Kyunki mahine ke end mein CA ko koi register nahi banana padta.

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:45.868
GSTR 1 mein aaj ka bill bhi aa gaya. Same state ka customer hai to CGST aur SGST, doosre state ka ho to IGST.

00:03:45.868 --> 00:03:50.132
Ye faisla app khud karta hai customer ke state se. Kyun?

00:03:50.132 --> 00:03:55.461
Kyunki galat tax head par bill banane se return mein mushkil hoti hai.

00:03:55.821 --> 00:03:57.273
Aur bill ka output.

00:03:57.273 --> 00:04:08.049
Kisi bhi bill ko kholo to A four ka bada invoice, 58 aur 80 millimetre ka thermal receipt, P D F aur WhatsApp, saare raaste ek hi jagah hain.

00:04:08.049 --> 00:04:14.392
Kyun? Kyunki alag dukaan mein alag printer hota hai, aur ek app sab par chalta hai.

00:04:14.748 --> 00:04:29.987
Aaj humne General Store ka flow dekha: bill discount aur udhaar ke saath, sales return, customer khata, naya item, stock, purchase, reports aur GST, aur bill ke alag alag output.

00:04:29.987 --> 00:04:37.606
Ek practical baat: pehle din sirf item, price aur GST bharo aur bill banana shuru kar do.

00:04:37.606 --> 00:04:43.599
Baaki cheezein, jaise stock ya barcode, jab zaroorat ho tab jodte jao.
